 144 | ### ⚠️ jules.py — `session_end` nina_sync.sh Error Masking (PARTIAL FIX)
 145 | **What was done:** `check=True` + `CalledProcessError` wrap added in today's commit.
 146 | **Remaining gap:** Errors are caught but only logged locally. If `nina_sync.sh` fails silently (non-zero exit with no exception), the Telegram user gets no notification and the session ledger is never updated.
 147 | **Priority:** 🟠 TODO-P2
 148 | 
 149 | **Jules spec when ready:**
 150 | ```
 151 | File: tools/jules.py — function: session_end
 152 | Goal: When nina_sync.sh raises CalledProcessError OR returns non-zero:
 153 |   - Log the failure with full stderr to nina_update_log.md via append_log
 154 |   - Send a Telegram alert: "⚠️ NINA sync failed after Jules session_end. Check logs."
 155 |   - Do NOT abort the session_end — sync failure is non-fatal, session must still close
 156 |   - Do NOT touch any file outside tools/jules.py
 157 |   - Acceptance: simulate failure by passing a bad path; confirm log entry + Telegram message
 158 | ```
