 249 | ### 🟠 TODO-P2 — juleslock.txt — Scope Enforcement in Pre-Push Hook
 250 | **Context:** `juleslock.txt` exists to prevent Jules from touching files locked by another session. But the pre-push governance hook (`pre-push` git hook) does NOT check `juleslock.txt`. If a Jules PR is mid-flight and a manual commit touches the same file, the push succeeds silently.
 251 | **Priority:** 🟠 P2
 252 | 
 253 | **Jules spec:**
 254 | ```
 255 | File: .git/hooks/pre-push (or whichever script runs the governance check)
 256 | Goal: Before allowing push, read juleslock.txt and check if any file in the current
 257 |   git diff (against origin/main) matches a locked file:
 258 |   - If match found: abort push with message:
 259 |     "BLOCKED: {filename} is locked in juleslock.txt (Jules session in flight).
 260 |      Wait for Jules PR or clear the lock manually."
 261 |   - If no match: proceed normally
 262 |   - Do NOT change validate_index.py or audit_repo_hygiene.py
 263 |   - Acceptance: lock a file in juleslock.txt, attempt to push a commit touching it,
 264 |     confirm push is blocked with the correct message
 265 | ```
